# Optional -- only needed to enable the GNN (Tc/Pc/omega from SMILES) option.
# The manual-entry path works with none of this set.
#
# Copy to .env (or export directly) and point these at wherever your trained
# DMPNN artifacts actually live. Neither is committed to this repo.

# Path to the merged bundle produced by gnn_pipeline.py (model_A, model_B,
# scaler_A, scaler_B, mol_scaler). Defaults to checkpoints/merged_pipeline.pt
# inside this project if unset.
# REFRIG_GNN_CHECKPOINT=/path/to/GNN/checkpoints/merged_pipeline.pt

# Directory containing gnn_pipeline.py, if it is not already importable
# (e.g. not copied/symlinked into this project and not on PYTHONPATH).
# REFRIG_GNN_PIPELINE_DIR=/path/to/GNN
